  "Pest control: no independent South Brunswick-based firm surfaced; results were regional chains (Terminix, Viking, Cowleys) or out-of-town independents.",
  "Locksmiths: only retail key-duplication kiosks (Home Depot / Minute Key) appear inside the township - no independent locksmith shop.",
  "Tree care: only one in-town operator surfaced; the category is dominated by East Brunswick and Milltown firms.",
  "Painting and electrical: both are dominated by East Brunswick/North Brunswick firms in map ranking; only a couple of in-town operators surfaced per query.",
  "Junk removal / hauling: no firm based in South Brunswick appeared in the top results.",
  "Solar installers and machine/welding shops were not surveyed - search budget ran out before those passes."
 ],
 "caveats": [
  "Zone = South Brunswick township only. Nearby towns (Milltown, East Brunswick, North Brunswick, Cranbury, Plainsboro, Princeton) were excluded by boundary test, even when a firm markets itself as serving South Brunswick.",
  "Several contractors register at home addresses in the township; for solo/home-based operators the street address was withheld and marked Unknown.",
  "Google's anonymous Maps view returns only the top 10 ranked results per query, so each category is a ranked sample, not an exhaustive list.",
  "Coordinates published by Google for service-area businesses sometimes point outside the township even when the firm works and is registered in South Brunswick; a few borderline cases are flagged in notes."
 ],
 "data_gaps": [
  "yellowpages.com, manta.com, chamberofcommerce.com, allpages.com, whereorg.com, citysquares.com and localitybiz.com all returned 403/Cloudflare blocks from this environment; no bulk directory cross-check was possible.",
  "Overpass API and mirrors were unreachable, so no OpenStreetMap POI extract could be used.",
  "No public business directory was found on the South Brunswick township website, and no South Brunswick chamber member list was reachable."
 ]
